Third-party material

This work is derived from ToolHop, a dataset released by ByteDance Ltd. under
the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://huggingface.co/datasets/bytedance-research/ToolHop

The benchmark's question texts, tool schemas and executable tool functions are
derived from ToolHop instances. ToolHop itself is NOT redistributed in this
archive; README.md gives the download URL and the sha256 the pipeline pins
(0a51f71a44b7025645e452123af3caf2e348301922af91778e268db0188a7fab).

Gold answers and distractor values were verified and sourced against Wikidata
(https://www.wikidata.org), whose data is dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0. Wikidata content is not redistributed here either; the querying code
is in code/scripts/build_distractors_wikidata.py and
code/scripts/verify_gold_wikidata.py.

Model weights, adapters and any evaluated third-party models are not included
in this archive and remain under their own licenses.
